
"""
Rigid halfshaft between an inboard differential and a wheel-joint axis flange.

The drive torque passes through unchanged (`flange_a` on the differential
side, `flange_b` on the wheel-joint side). A joint's axis flange applies its
torque between the wheel and the joint carrier, which is correct when the
actuator is mounted on the carrier (a brake caliper, a hub motor) but not for
a wheel driven through a halfshaft: there the carrier holds only the wheel
bearing and the drive reaction is carried by the differential housing.
`frame_a` must be connected to the joint carrier; the component applies the
axis torque back to it, cancelling the joint's carrier reaction so that the
net drive reaction is left where the differential housing puts it (see the
`housing_reaction` parameter of drivelines).

The pass-through equates the two flange angles, so the drive angle is
measured relative to the joint carrier rather than relative to the
differential housing. This neglects carrier rotation about the wheel axis,
which is small for suspension travel and steering motion.

`n` is the joint axis resolved in `frame_a` and must match the `n` of the
joint whose axis flange `flange_b` drives.
"""
component HalfShaft
  "Differential side"
  flange_a = Spline() {^flange_a}
  "Wheel-joint axis flange side"
  flange_b = Spline() {^flange_b}
  "Joint carrier (e.g. suspension upright); receives the compensating torque"
  frame_a = Frame3D() {^frame_a}
  "Joint axis of rotation, resolved in frame_a"
  parameter n::Real[3] = [0, 0, 1]
  final parameter e::Real[3] = MultibodyComponents.normalize_(n)
relations
  flange_a.phi = flange_b.phi
  0 = flange_a.tau + flange_b.tau
  frame_a.f = [0, 0, 0]
  frame_a.tau = e * flange_b.tau
metadata {
  "Dyad": {
    "icons": {"default": "dyad://SedanDemo/HalfShaft.svg"},
    "labels": [
      {
        "label": "$(instance)",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 120,
        "rot": 0,
        "attrs": {"font-size": "140"}
      }
    ]
  },
  "_links": {
    "flange_a": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": -50, "y1": 450, "x2": 50, "y2": 550, "rot": 180}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "flange_b": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 950, "y1": 450, "x2": 1050, "y2": 550, "rot": 0}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "frame_a": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 450, "y1": 950, "x2": 550, "y2": 1050, "rot": 90}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    }
  }
}
end
